Package: xfce4-profile-editor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Chris Clayton <chris@chrisclayton.dev>
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPENDS@, accountsservice, hicolor-icon-theme
Homepage: https://github.com/camelofcode/xfce4-profile-editor
Description: Edit your Xfce display name and profile image
 Xfce Profile Editor changes the current user's display name and profile image
 through the same system interfaces used by the Xfce Whisker Menu.
